    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 3D collectathon platformer videogame featuring 200 addictive levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017980/extras/cab557e7e35ca58f41d3e3fe956bbcf8.avif?t=1752610954\" data-has-big width=800 height=613 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A digital virus has corrupted the DigiWorld, and the bots that reside within are now under the control of the evil MegaBot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s fate lies on the small shoulders of a defective bot untouched by the virus named Digi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He must collect all the DigiOrbs that DigiWorld\u2019s antivirus defence system has released. Digi may be too small to face the corrupted bots head-on, but he can dodge his way to saving the DigiWorld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digi get Dodging!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017980/extras/fdf2ce9793e56fb3fc54ba117346ad07.avif?t=1752610954\" data-has-big width=800 height=417 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A 3D collectathon platformer videogame featuring 200 addictive levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017980/extras/cab557e7e35ca58f41d3e3fe956bbcf8.avif?t=1752610954\" data-has-big width=800 height=613 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A digital virus has corrupted the DigiWorld, and the bots that reside within are now under the control of the evil MegaBot. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world\u2019s fate lies on the small shoulders of a defective bot untouched by the virus named Digi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He must collect all the DigiOrbs that DigiWorld\u2019s antivirus defence system has released. Digi may be too small to face the corrupted bots head-on, but he can dodge his way to saving the DigiWorld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digi get Dodging!!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3017980/extras/fdf2ce9793e56fb3fc54ba117346ad07.avif?t=1752610954\" data-has-big width=800 height=417 /></span></p>",
